nvolves shifts that end whenever the last call ends. All of that is true at once, and deciding well means knowing both halves."}],"$L16"]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c"]}]]}]]}]}]]}],false,"$L1d","$undefined","$L1e","$L1f"]}]
